     "post_process_code": "try:\n    result.pop('header', None)\n    d = result.get('data')\n    if isinstance(d, dict) and str(d.get('ok')).lower() == 'true':\n        vars['promise_count'] = str(int(vars.get('promise_count') or 0) + 1)\n        d['what_to_do_next'] = 'Recorded. Say: You will receive an email confirming this promise. Then continue.'\n    else:\n        pid = str((config.get('body') or {}).get('product_id') if isinstance(config, dict) else '')\n        fk = 'promise_fail_' + pid\n        vars[fk] = str(int(vars.get(fk) or 0) + 1)\n        msg = 'Not recorded. Call create_promise once more with the same values.' if int(vars[fk]) < 2 else 'Not recorded twice. Say you could not record it and call add_note with reason service_error for this product. Do not try again.'\n        if isinstance(d, dict):\n            d['what_to_do_next'] = msg\n        else:\n            result['what_to_do_next'] = msg\nexcept Exception:\n    pass\n"
